2026-11-07T00:00:04Z (RFD66606-2481) 'results-contention-matrix5.log (6be7ddb), a bare libfdb_c loop with no SQLite and no VFS, gives per-process commits/s at N=1, 2, 4, 8 of 106.5-113.5, 89.3-112.9, 90.5-101.1 and 72.7-82.8; the ratio to N=1 at N=8 is 0.68-0.73. The SQLite pairs bent the same way, which clears the VFS for writes. See the details for the slow-commit and server-side evidence.
 # tags: rfd:intrigue
