2026-11-07T00:00:10Z (RFD66606-2481) '- Fixed before the run: if the desk shows the same bend and the same stalls, the cause sits in the cluster or commit path, and this Mac is cleared. If the desk is flat and stall-free, this Mac's disk or scheduler is implicated. Anything in between is reported as measured, with no cause named.
 # tags: rfd:decision
